      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE BONT (1) had been racing well with a Grade 5 win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. Likely to improve sharply this time. SWEET JORDIE (4) resumed in a Grade 5 at this track and ran into the frame when third over 525m (30.99). Sure to be fitter. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Well placed and gets her chance. WANGARATTA GIRL (8) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in her dominant 28.07 win at Bendigo over 500m. Must include on winning run two back. PHOENIX TAN (3) is not to be discarded.",
